Package: Gonzalez
Title: Simple Data Summary Tools For Students
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Zara", "Gonzalez", email = "zaragonzalez@usf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Zara Gonzalez
Maintainer: Zara Gonzalez <zaragonzalez@usf.edu>
Description: I created Gonzalez as a beginner-friendly R package for quickly
    inspecting small data sets in R. It includes simple tools for reviewing data
    frame structure, checking missing values, summarizing numeric columns, and
    visualizing category counts.
